# NOTE: the real deploy builds from the slim ./deploy.sh staging dir (.deploy/),
# which already contains only the 20 Spider dev DBs. This file is a safety net so
# that an accidental `docker build .` / `gcloud run deploy --source .` at the repo
# root never uploads the full 1.7G dataset or any secrets.

# --- build hygiene ---
.git
.gitignore
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.vscode/
.claude/
.python-version
.deploy/

# --- secrets: never bake into an image ---
.env

# --- dev-only docs (not needed at runtime) ---
PROGRESS.md
CLAUDE.md
IMPROVEMENTS.md
DEPLOY.md

# --- heavy / irrelevant data (the dashboard only needs the 20 dev DBs) ---
# deploy.sh stages those into .deploy/; a root build intentionally ships none.
data/spider/
data/eval_runs/
data/*.db
